      "tests/fixtures/skills/native-project-package.handoff.json (reference output, copied expectations)",
      "tests/fixtures/web-project-package.zip :: plan.json (case 1 input, verbatim)",
      "tests/fixtures/native-project-package.zip :: plan.json (case 2 input, verbatim + the room ring documented below)",
      "src/lib/skills/handoff.ts (the ported function)"
