    "translation": "No invented numbers. Both inputs are the plan.json records extracted verbatim from the zip fixtures. Case 2 additionally carries the room polygon that ArchiPlan roomDetection derives (the fixture plan.json only stores the label centre); handoff.ts read its areas from plan.statistics, our port measures them.",
