      "what": "livingArea / floorArea / ceilingArea are numbers for case 2 where the ArchiPlan reference output has null",
      "why": "handoff.ts only READS plan.statistics; the native fixture package has no statistics block, so the reference shows null. Our port derives the areas itself (interior-area.js + ceiling-reconstruct.js), which is exactly the gap this port closes. Reference null vs ours 10.9725-style numbers is expected, not a bug.",
      "referenceNulls": {
        "case2": {
          "summary.livingArea": null,
          "levels[0].livingArea": null,
          "levels[0].rooms[0].floorArea": null,
          "levels[0].rooms[0].boundaryWallRun": null
        }
      }
